OL,3,GNEWSAM1 closures after lorry overturns
OL,4,
OL,5,FClosures are in place on the M1 in
OL,6,FLeicestershire after a lorry overturned
OL,7,Fon to the central reservation barrier.
OL,9,FAt about 05:30 BST on Friday, National
OL,10,FHighways said the motorway was shut in
OL,11,Fboth directions between junction 24 at
OL,12,FKegworth and junction 23A for East
OL,13,FMidlands Airport, on the northbound
OL,14,Fside.
OL,16,FIt added specialist recovery units were
OL,17,Fon their way to the scene and added a
OL,18,F"complex recovery operation" would be
OL,19,Fongoing throughout the morning.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
