OL,3,GNEWSAM1 closures after lorry overturns
OL,4,
OL,5,FIn an update at 07:10, the agency said
OL,6,Fthe closure on the southbound
OL,7,Fcarriageway had been changed to between
OL,8,Fjunctions 23A and 23. The northbound
OL,9,Fclosure remains the same.
